Scope: this repository is the open "trust primitives" layer of the project —
the template validator, the cel-eng/1 policy engine, the policy co-signer, the
shipped templates/policies, and the conformance vectors. An operated service
built on top of these primitives (hosted co-signer, facilitator, arbiter,
indexer) may be offered separately under different terms.

This software interacts with the XRP Ledger and depends on third-party
packages (including xrpl.js, ripple-binary-codec, ripple-keypairs and
@marcbachmann/cel-js), each under its own license.
